ID & Copy Button) -->\\r\\n          <div class=\\\"reg-step-card reg-step-highlight\\\" id=\\\"host-reg-step-3\\\">\\r\\n            <div class=\\\"reg-step-header\\\">\\r\\n              <span class=\\\"reg-step-num\\\">03<\\/span>\\r\\n              <div class=\\\"reg-step-icon\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\r\\n                <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"\\r\\n                  stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\">\\r\\n                  <rect x=\\\"3\\\" y=\\\"11\\\" width=\\\"18\\\" height=\\\"11\\\" rx=\\\"2\\\" ry=\\\"2\\\"><\\/rect>\\r\\n                  <path d=\\\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\\\"><\\/path>\\r\\n                <\\/svg>\\r\\n              <\\/div>\\r\\n            <\\/div>\\r\\n            <h3 class=\\\"reg-step-title\\\">Step 3: Enter Your Agency ID<\\/h3>\\r\\n            <p class=\\\"reg-step-desc\\\">\\r\\n              Open the Join Agency form and enter the Agency ID provided by the agency you want to join (2527626) .\\r\\n              Check the agency information before submitting\\r\\n            <\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n            <!-- Prominent Agency ID Copy Box -->\\r\\n            <div class=\\\"agency-id-callout\\\">\\r\\n              <div class=\\\"agency-id-label\\\">Official Agency ID to Enter<\\/div>\\r\\n              <div class=\\\"agency-id-row\\\">\\r\\n                <span class=\\\"agency-id-code\\\" id=\\\"agency-code-text\\\">2527626<\\/span>\\r\\n                <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"btn-copy-id\\\" id=\\\"btn-copy-agency-id\\\" onclick=\\\"copyAgencyId()\\\"\\r\\n                  aria-label=\\\"Copy Agency ID 2527626\\\">\\r\\n                  <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"\\r\\n                    stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"